                    <ref target="#d283">Document 283</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d285-f4" n="4" xml:id="d285-f4-content">
                <p>President Johnson nominated Abe Fortas, an Associate Justice of the Supreme
                    Court, to be Chief Justice on June 26.</p>
            </note>
